id: E3700
trigger_tool: ld.lld
phase: linking
error_signature: undefined symbol: pthread_cancel|ld.lld: error: undefined symbol: pthread_cancel|pthread_cancel.*not found
severity: 3
category: platform,threading,musl
match_keywords: pthread_cancel, pthread_setcancelstate, musl, OHOS, thread cancellation, undefined symbol
title: OHOS musl 缺少 pthread_cancel，阻塞线程需改协作式取消
root_cause: OHOS 使用 musl，未实现 POSIX 线程取消（pthread_cancel/pthread_setcancelstate/pthread_testcancel）；依赖取消来终止阻塞线程的代码在链接期缺符号，运行期也无法退出
affected_scope: 所有依赖 pthread 取消终止后台线程的 C/C++ 项目；与 E1603 属于同一符号族，E1603 覆盖构建期特性探测与有界 poll，本条覆盖最小协作式取消改造
verification_cmd: llvm-nm -D -u libncbi-vdb.so | grep pthread_cancel || echo 'no pthread_cancel dependency'
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: 构建期探测 pthread_cancel（check_c_source_compiles 链接测试）并定义 HAVE_PTHREAD_CANCEL；有能力时保留原取消路径，无能力时工作线程用 cancel 标志 + 条件变量唤醒协作退出，通用 API 返回 rcUnsupported
rec_description: 能力探测优先，协作式取消作为无 pthread_cancel 时的兜底；不要用空符号或平台宏
rec_auto_fix: false
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to: [E1603]
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
doc_file: doc/E3700.md
last_updated: 2026-10-23
source_pr: 16850
source_commit: ef4d76d7
